00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:36.920
Nobunaga .

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.350
Bagaimana ?

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.170
Aku di sini untuk harta rahasiamu .

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:43.800
